  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop teachers training plan for Mechatronics, Arrange an invitation training to Korea for teachers on Mechatronics, Dispatch Korean experts to India to provide an in-service training for teahcers on Mechatronics, Provide Mechatronics equipments,and Provide training to run and maintain the equipments</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
